Firmware for scenarios/rf: the project's config with the third and fourth loads
on remote units 1 and 2 (nodes 15 and 16, REMOTE_NODE_ID in the receiver's config_rf.h).
The RFM69 takes D2 (IRQ) and D10 to D13 (SPI): the local loads stay on D5 and D6, the
override pin on D4.

  PVR_SIM_BUILD=1 sh sim/configs/sim_config.sh
  sed -n '/^diff --git/,$p' sim/configs/remote_loads.patch | patch -p1    # or git apply --unidiff-zero
  PLATFORMIO_BUILD_DIR=.pio/build-rf pio run --project-dir Mk2_1phase_RFdatalog_temp -e basic

diff --git a/Mk2_1phase_RFdatalog_temp/config.h b/Mk2_1phase_RFdatalog_temp/config.h
